        actionsSettings.innerHTML=`<div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Actions</h2><p>Let users with server control request a bounded plan. Every proposed action waits for a separate confirmation.</p></div><span class="status-badge ${settings.actions_enabled?'good':'muted'}"><i></i>${settings.actions_enabled?'AVAILABLE':'OFF'}</span></div><form id="assistant-actions-settings-form"><label class="checkline"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" ${settings.actions_enabled?'checked':''}>Enable proposed server actions</label><p class="muted-copy">The allow-list is start, stop, restart and safe restart. Docklight re-checks access at execution and records each action.</p><div id="assistant-actions-settings-state" class="assistant-test-result" role="status"></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button subtle" type="submit">Save Actions setting</button></div></form>`;
